    "turn_idx": 9,
    "turn_text": "Is it messaging in the, for example, is there a messaging problem or a messaging fix that needs to happen? You guys, I mean, it really isn't different between the two parties. It's all about image and messaging. Do you think you can kick that up a little bit in Hamilton County in the future?",
