        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker trusts Republican leadership to deliver effective anti-poverty outcomes.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "There exists a clear moral imperative to promote self-reliance over state support.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "The status quo represents stagnation and resistance to meaningful progress.",
        "confidence": 0.85
      },
      {
        "text": "Defining success in terms of independence aligns with broader societal well-being.",
