    "turn_idx": 11,
    "turn_text": "You know, it's always tough in these midterms historically. We know what the numbers are and we knew how it was going to flip, most probably flip blue for the house last night. But as we sit here this morning, it looks like it's plus 35, maybe plus 36 right now for the damocrats. And I'm just wondering if that was a number that now the election has all said and done. Was that a number that you thought it would be? Was it higher? Is it lower?",
