        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker believes the election result should be evaluated against pre-election expectations.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "A significant Democratic gain in the House reflects a meaningful shift in voter sentiment.",
