    "turn_idx": 12,
    "turn_text": "I think it's, well, it depends on the pundit you're talking to, but I think it's well. I mean, it's very interesting if you compare, and I'm not big on this step, Ken, but I've been looking at it since I've been in office, but if you look at after Quentin's first term at the midterm and Barack Obama's at the midterm. They lost far more seats than what happened last night in the House of Representatives. And they certainly didn't pick up Senate seats that I'm aware of. So I think it is interesting that, you know, there's a Trump effect probably",
